          "model": "nodes",
          "example": "baseline",
          "reuse": "Edit gas pressure, composition and basis, then table temperatures/mode or reactor model, initial temperature, sample times and tolerances using shared source/property authoring. Plan a fresh revision; execute and inspect the same CSV/summary. Use the equilibrium/adiabatic examples for reactive equilibrium states and the reactor example for time histories. The thermal template permits editing total conductance W/K and fixed bath K; use zero conductance to compare adiabatic behaviour. Public acceptance edits the same durable draft and verifies workflow resume."
        },
